# beads (br): the local SQLite tracker plus every fsqlite/migration sidecar it
# drops next to it — WAL/shm, ns-gate/ns-use, wal-cert, pre-migration backups,
# schema-migration vacuum candidates, and the .br_recovery receipts. All of it
# is per-checkout state rebuilt from issues.jsonl, which stays tracked as the
# shared source of truth.
**/.beads/*.db
**/.beads/*.db-*
**/.beads/*.db.*
**/.beads/.beads.db.schema-migration-*
**/.beads/.br_recovery/
